265
00:27:14.160 --> 00:27:30.059
Carly Huitema (University of Guelph): Sam Smith was talking about how only Carrie does anchored signatures, and people aren't more aware of the risk and stuff, so then I said, oh, could I talk with somebody to make a script to make people more aware of the risk then? So I did some of this with Kent Bull.

